[resource]
script = ExtResource("1_sxcry")
from = " Luca Russalo "
to = " Group Chat \"Humor Hangout\" "
subject = " Annual Invitation To Le Epic LAN Party "
content = " Do I even need to spell it out? 🤓
 
 You all know what time it is! My place (11th Eastlane Avenue), starting next week, our week-long LAN is going to be crazy. 🔥 I have all of my favorites on the Cloudstation, including, but not limited to: Alpha Combat, Dino Track Racing, Deflection Strike: The Planetary Defense, Enter Umbra, Topview: Surf Life, and even this new hit called \"Fjord Fury.\" 
 
 Be there or be square and make sure to bring enough water, food and snacks to last the week! See you guys there! 👌"
